「滚滚新世纪」已进入第五个年头。从二○二○年代的AI浪潮到地缘政治的风云变幻，台积电站在历史的十字路口。

张忠谋在二○一八年交棒时说：台积电的「需要」在快速成长。五年后，这句话得到了超乎预期的验证——生成式AI对先进制程的需求，让台积电成为全球科技产业最重要的战略资源。

从一九三五到二○二四，台积电从一个政府主导的「政策工具」，蜕变为全球不可或缺的「技术平台」。张忠谋用三十年时间，缔造了一个真正的世界级企业。

「自传下冊」——关于理想、关于坚持、关于创新与传承的故事，至此划下句号。

<div class="rebook-translation">
<span class="rebook-translation__label">ReadShift 双语翻译</span>
<p class="en-para">## Epilogue</p>
<p class="en-para">The 'rolling new century' has entered its fifth year. From the AI wave of the 2020s to the shifting winds of geopolitics, TSMC stands at a historical crossroads.</p>
<p class="en-para">When Morris Chang handed over the baton in 2018, he said TSMC's 'need' was growing rapidly. Five years later, that statement has been validated beyond expectation—generative AI's demand for advanced process nodes has made TSMC the most critical strategic asset in the global technology industry.</p>
<p class="en-para">From 1987 to 2024, TSMC transformed from a government-directed 'policy tool' into a globally indispensable 'technology platform.' Morris Chang spent thirty years building a genuine world-class enterprise.</p>
<p class="en-para">The 'Autobiography, Volume II'—a story about ideals, perseverance, innovation, and succession—comes to its close here.</p>
</div>
